# C2/STO-3G FCIQMC -- the validation fixture for the three convergence tests.
#
# 10 orbitals, 6 alpha / 6 beta, ndet = 44100. Chosen over N2/STO-3G (14400)
# because the WALKER-POPULATION sweep needs room below saturation: at N2 a
# 120k-walker point is 8.3 walkers/determinant, which covers the space and
# stops exercising the sampling being validated (the trap F4.4 and F4.5 both
# hit). At C2 the same sweep spans 0.11-0.91 walkers/det, entirely below 1.
#
# Chosen over N2/3-21g (1.01e9 determinants) because all three tests are
# DEFINED as comparisons against deterministic FCI, and at 1e9 determinants
# there is no reference to compare against -- 8.1 GB per CI vector, ~65 GB for
# a Davidson subspace, and an extrapolated ~9.6 yr solve. The tests do not
# degrade at that size; they stop existing.
#
# C2/STO-3G is also the most valuable of the cheap fixtures for a p_gen hunt:
# at 6a/6b it sits between Be (2/2) and N2 (7/7) at N2's orbital count, so the
# three vary ELECTRON COUNT against fixed orbitals rather than moving ndet and
# electron count together.
#
# NOTE: C2/STO-3G is a genuinely multireference system -- the ground state has
# substantial weight outside the RHF determinant. That is a FEATURE for test 3
# (more determinants carry resolvable signed weight) but it means the reference
# determinant holds a smaller share of the population than in N2, so the
# projected energy needs a healthy walker count to stay usable.
#
# dt is NOT inherited from the N2 input. N2's 0.001 was measured there, against
# a sign instability in ITS reference determinant; C2 has different diagonals
# and must be checked on its own (the driver's SIGN-UNSTABLE warning is the
# instrument). This value is a starting point pending that check.

%begin_control
    basis       sto-3g
    calculation energy
    verbosity   verbose
    basis_type  cartesian
%end_control

%begin_scf
    scf_type    rhf
    correlation fciqmc
    ci_max_dim  200000

    fciqmc_walkers         20000
    fciqmc_timestep        0.001
    fciqmc_shift_damping   0.3
    fciqmc_shift_restoring 0.05
    fciqmc_shift_interval  5
    fciqmc_granularity     1.0
    fciqmc_initiator       0.0
    fciqmc_equilibration   20000
    fciqmc_steps           30000
    fciqmc_spawn_attempts  1
    fciqmc_seed            20250901

    use_diis    .true.
    diis_dim    8
    save_checkpoint .false.
    engine      os
    guess       hcore
%end_scf

%begin_geom
    coord_type  cartesian
    coord_units angstrom
    use_symm    .false.
%end_geom

%begin_coords
2
0   1
C     0.000000     0.000000     0.000000
C     0.000000     0.000000     1.243000
%end_coords
